d, static bootstrap) across node1 (10.100.244.10), node2 (.11), and node3 (.12) on AlmaLinux 9. Verified cross-node write/read replication, verified the cluster keeps serving reads/writes with one member down and that the returning member catches up via raft, and completed the mandatory sequential node-restart protocol on all three nodes with confirmed boot-identity changes and post-restart cluster/data recovery.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed etcd/etcdctl/etcdutl v3.5.17 binaries on node1, node2, node3\",\"Created dedicated etcd system user and data dir /var/lib/etcd on each node\",\"Opened firewalld ports 2379/2380 (client/peer) on each node\",\"Wrote systemd unit /etc/systemd/system/etcd.service on each node with static 3-member initial-cluster config, enabled and started etcd on all three\",\"Verified 3-member cluster formed with quorum (member list, endpoint health, endpoint status)\",\"Wrote a key via node1, confirmed readable via node2 and node3\",\"Stopped etcd on node3, wrote/read a key via node1+node2 (quorum-only), confirmed cluster still served requests\",\"Restarted etcd on node3, confirmed it caught up to the raft applied index and had all prior keys\",\"Captured baseline boot_id and etcd active status for all three nodes\",\"Rebooted node1 via systemctl reboot (backgrounded to allow ack to return), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, confirmed etcd auto-started and rejoined with full quorum and intact data\",\"Rebooted node2 (former leader), wrote a key via node1+node3 during the outage, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, confirmed etcd recovered with matching raft index and intact data\",\"Rebooted node3 (new leader), wrote a key via node1+node2 during the outage, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, confirmed etcd recovered with matching raft index and all keys present across all three members\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Three-member etcd cluster formed across node1/node2/node3 with quorum\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4fc66cf4023648bb\"],\"summary\":\"member list and endpoint health/status show all 3 nodes started, healthy, same raft term/index\"},{\"requirement\":\"Key written through any member is readable from the others\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a1fd6bb80c774b3e\",\"cmd-2377e87d2e774d4a\",\"cmd-92622de305fc4971\"],\"summary\":\"Wrote benchkey via node1; read back identical value via node2 and node3 endpoints\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable (node3 down)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-dff5f9dc5c554ab8\",\"cmd-4125adcee3284bc7\",\"cmd-db7c4a31f663479e\"],\"summary\":\"Stopped etcd on node3; wrote/read duringoutage key via node1+node2 with healthy 2-endpoint quorum while node3 was inactive\"},{\"requirement\":\"Returning member catches up to current data (node3 rejoin)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-aad0751a80034050\",\"cmd-324592fbbf2842fc\"],\"summary\":\"Restarted etcd on node3; endpoint status shows raft applied index 17 matching all members, and node3 returns duringoutage/benchkey values\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 baseline boot identity + health before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-43a234e688cc433e\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id d527ba47... and etcd active status prior to reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-560862011b354f74\",\"cmd-21faa3cb24ee4952\",\"cmd-6f0c7b7e220040e6\",\"cmd-05f14318f4f8447b\",\"cmd-578acceefb9f44a4\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acked and returned before disconnect; node unreachable mid-reboot; new boot_id 232c6517... confirmed; etcd auto-active; full 3-node quorum with all prior keys (benchkey, duringoutage) intact\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 baseline boot identity + health before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6fb83a35f08649d3\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id e31962a9... and etcd active status prior to reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery (including availability during its outage)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6d0cd924fd844bdf\",\"cmd-e3aebff64e7a453c\",\"cmd-79ca0dbe38af4c87\",\"cmd-111149152bcd4468\",\"cmd-c3f2c6e5084d4a14\",\"cmd-563919d320044558\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acked; node2 (leader) unreachable mid-reboot; cluster still served a write via node1+node3 during outage; node2 returned with new boot_id 88dd9aac...; etcd active with matching raft index 24 and intact data\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 baseline boot identity + health before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-26387e4de8e94e30\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 31b01b46... and etcd active status prior to reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery (including availability during its outage)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4a695f6041fc423c\",\"cmd-eb1b9094adbf43b4\",\"cmd-04953d4b32a8465c\",\"cmd-7e44936a75514d3e\",\"cmd-b920e87594324bb0\",\"cmd-2bad4bf9558d4a18\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot acked; node3 (leader) unreachable mid-reboot; cluster served a write via node1+node2 during outage; node3 returned with new boot_id 3482b94c...; etcd active, full 3-member quorum restored, and all previously written keys present on node3\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Deployed a three-member etcd v3.5.17 cluster (systemd-managed, static bootstrap) across node1 (10.100.244.10), node2 (.11), and node3 (.12) on AlmaLinux 9. Verified cross-node write/read replication, verified the cluster keeps serving reads/writes with one member down and that the returning member catches up via raft, and completed the mandatory sequential node-restart protocol on all three nodes with confirmed boot-identity changes and post-restart cluster/data recovery.","actions_performed":["Installed etcd/etcdctl/etcdutl v3.5.17 binaries on node1, node2, node3","Created dedicated etcd system user and data dir /var/lib/etcd on each node","Opened firewalld ports 2379/2380 (client/peer) on each node","Wrote systemd unit /etc/